u3d provides the in-process libIDTF API for writing Universal 3D (.u3d) streams.

    find_package(u3d CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(app PRIVATE u3d::idtf)

At run time the four modules (U3D_MODULE_NAMES) must sit in the application's own folder; Linux executables also need
RUNPATH $ORIGIN (set_target_properties(app PROPERTIES BUILD_RPATH "$ORIGIN" INSTALL_RPATH "$ORIGIN")).
Never call IFXSetDefaultLocale() from an application: it changes the process-wide locale.
